  "articleBody": "It's easy for bathroom remodel costs to spiral if you're not careful. One of the biggest mistakes folks make is underbudgeting from the start. You've got your Pinterest board full of amazing ideas, but have you checked what those elements actually cost? Another common pitfall is not clearly defining how changes, potential delays, or unexpected issues will impact your overall budget and timeline. When you're making a big investment, you want to know exactly what you're getting into financially. It’s also important to confirm who handles permits and inspections – those can add costs and delays if not managed properly. To avoid these budgetbusters, start with a solid vision and a realistic budget, then get multiple itemized quotes. Ask each contractor to break down costs so you can compare apples to apples. And don't be shy about asking about their process for handling change orders or unexpected issues. We believe in transparency at HH Remodeling LLC, so you'll always know where your money is going.",
  "datePublished": "2026-08-09"
}